## A. Root cause of B7's abstention (diagnosis of the SPENT v1.4 held-out seeds, B7 only)
Re-ran B7 on base 3905077000 (8 per class), held_out and control, every cap, with the evaluator-side
diagnosis. B7 is unchanged: 1791 of 1792 runs identical to the recorded v1.4 rows (digest, ledger
chain head, category); one (control width_narrow-03 cap 48) differs in the arm's result digest only
(same chain head, same category). Diagnosis-only use of spent data; not evidence.
Cause table: `--cause-table development/dev_3905077000_8_*_rows.json --arms B7` (report section 2).

